WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.449 --> 00:00:06.140
The long weekend is coming up, and I hope you join us here at Kaiapoi's Trousselot

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:09.200
Park for the annual district Waitangi Day Celebrations.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.709
This whole area will be jam-packed full of
stalls, and there will be something to see,

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:17.990
do and eat for every member of the family
- with free entertainment all day long.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.660
Pony rides, Devonshire teas, and a period-costume competition are just some of the highlights this year.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.739
And if your brain needs a workout, put on
your sleuthing cap and search the town centre

00:00:27.739 --> 00:00:30.930
for clues in our Waitangi Day Quiz.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:37.080
All that and more, for the Waitangi Day Celebrations here at Kaiapoi's Trousselot Park between 10am and 2pm.

